From aa7e5dcc5cef7d1c1ea47fdb0bd47a5a66de0141 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Van Tran <trantoanvan@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 12:07:40 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(cli): report fork build identity and allow disabling
 update checks

The version comes from package.json, so a release build stamped with a
fork version reports it in --version and status. A stamped package.json
("vanttFork": true) adds a build field to status. OHS_DISABLE_UPDATE_CHECK=1
turns off the npm registry update check in the CLI and the MCP server.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
